  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Training Programmes ITP 2006-2013 - ITP -Tickets</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Training Programmes ITP 2006-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Training Programmes contribute to capacity development and processes of change in Vietnam and other developing countries by offering key persons training programmes in subject areas given priority in Swedish development cooperation, in which Swedish expertise is in demand, and in which use is made of experiences from countries at different stages of development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationella utbildningsprogram bidrar till kapacitetsutveckling och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsprocesser i Vietnam och andra utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder genom att erbjuda nyckelpersoner utbildningar inom &#xe4;mnesomr&#xe5;den som prioriteras i det svenska utvecklingssamarbetet, d&#xe4;r svenskt kunnande &#xe4;r efterfr&#xe5;gat, och d&#xe4;r erfarenheter utnyttjas fr&#xe5;n l&#xe4;nder i olika stadier av utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
